---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Shop — Bonfire Networks
description: Prints and objects created with artists around the Bonfire community.
permalink: /shop/index.html
image: /img/shop/bonfire-release-a3.jpg
---

<main class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-night text-ink font-body">
  <div class="v2-ambient" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-5 pb-20 pt-10 sm:px-7 sm:pb-24 sm:pt-14" aria-labelledby="shop-title">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-ink/10 pb-7 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between sm:gap-10">
      <div>
        <p class="font-smono text-[.68rem] font-bold tracking-[.1em] text-spark">BONFIRE</p>
        <h1 id="shop-title" class="mt-2 font-disp text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,4.8rem)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-.04em] text-ink">Shop</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-[36rem] text-[1rem] leading-7 text-ink-2">Art prints and objects made with artists around the Bonfire community.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8">
      <div class="mb-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-5">
        <h2 id="available-title" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-leaf"><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-leaf" aria-hidden="true"></span>Available now</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-3">1 item</p>
      </div>

      <article class="group grid overflow-hidden rounded-[1rem] bg-night-2/55 shadow-[0_28px_70px_-42px_rgba(0,0,0,.9)] md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr]">
        <a href="{{ shop.product.url }}" class="order-1 block overflow-hidden bg-[#dedbd2] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-spark" aria-label="View the Bonfire limited-edition screen-print">
          <img
            src="{{ shop.product.image }}"
            width="{{ shop.product.imageWidth }}"
            height="{{ shop.product.imageHeight }}"
            alt="Black-and-white Bonfire screen print showing forest animals gathered around fires under a crescent moon"
            class="h-full min-h-[18rem] w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.012] md:min-h-[34rem]"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
          >
        </a>

        <div class="order-2 flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 p-6 sm:p-9 lg:p-12">
          <div>
            <p class="font-smono text-[.65rem] font-bold tracking-[.1em] text-spark"><a href="{{ shop.product.artistUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline decoration-spark/45 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-ink focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark">ROCCO LOMBARDI</a> × BONFIRE</p>
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-disp text-[clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4rem)] font-semibold leading-[.94] tracking-[-.035em] text-ink">The Bonfire Screen Print</h3>
            <p class="mt-5 max-w-[31rem] text-[1rem] leading-7 text-ink-2">A handmade, one-colour screen-print on fine 300gsm stock, signed and numbered by <a href="{{ shop.product.artistUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-medium text-ink underline decoration-ink/30 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-spark focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark">Rocco Lombardi</a>.</p>

            <dl class="mt-8 border-y border-ink/10 text-sm">
              <div class="flex justify-between gap-5 border-b border-ink/10 py-3.5">
                <dt class="text-ink-3">Edition</dt>
                <dd class="font-medium text-ink">250 · signed and numbered</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between gap-5 border-b border-ink/10 py-3.5">
                <dt class="text-ink-3">Size</dt>
                <dd class="font-medium text-ink">{{ shop.product.dimensions }}</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between gap-5 py-3.5">
                <dt class="text-ink-3">Delivery</dt>
                <dd class="text-right font-medium text-ink">EU only · protective tube</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="mb-5 flex items-end justify-between gap-4">
              <p class="text-sm text-ink-3">35 × 50 cm</p>
              <p class="font-disp text-[2.7rem] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-.035em] text-ink">€{{ shop.product.price }}</p>
            </div>
            <a
              href="{{ shop.orderUrl }}"
              class="group/buy inline-flex min-h-14 w-full items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-spark via-flame to-ember px-6 py-4 font-smono text-[.78rem] font-bold tracking-[.04em] text-[#221302] shadow-[0_18px_34px_-18px_rgba(232,145,43,.72)] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-night active:translate-y-0"
              {% if shop.stripeEnabled %}rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %}
            >
              {{ 'Buy the print' if shop.stripeEnabled else 'Order the print' }} — €{{ shop.product.price }}
              <span class="transition-transform group-hover/buy:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
            <a href="{{ shop.product.url }}" class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:text-spark focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark">View the print and its story <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            {% if shop.testMode %}
              <p class="mt-1 text-center font-smono text-[.62rem] leading-5 text-corn-2">STRIPE TEST CHECKOUT · NO REAL CHARGE</p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
